n til midnight every day with a student access card and until 2 am during exam periods. Opening hours may change during organised events, such as conferences and meetings. All buildings Fri: 7:30 am - 4 pm Weekends: Closed Weekends: Closed Weekends: Closed Fri: 8 am - 5 pm Sat: 9 am - 12 pm Sun: Closed Sat: 8 am - 5 pm Sun: Closed Weekends: Closed Sat: 7:30 am - 5 pm Sun: Closed Weekends: Closed Weekends: Closed​​​​​​ Weekends: Closed Weekends: Closed Sat: 7:30 am - 5 pm Sun: Closed Weekends: Closed Sat: 7:30 am - 5 pm Sun: Closed Weekends: Closed Weekends: Closed Closed during lunch 12 to 1 pm. Weekends: Closed Weekends: Closed Weekends: Closed Sat: 7:30 am - 5 pm Sun: Closed Fri: 7 am - 8 pm Sat: 8 am - 6 pm Sun: Closed Sat: 7:30 am - 5 pm Sun: Closed Weekends: Closed Sat: 7:30 am - 5 pm Sun: Closed Weekends: Closed Share Did this help? Why wasn't this information helpful Too much information Not enough information to answer my question This isn't what I was looking for I tried this and it didn't solve the problem I don't like this feature or policy Other Tell us more Limit to 250 characters. University of Iceland SÆMUNDARGATA 2 102 REYKJAVIK Ssn. 600169-2039 Map of Campus Electronic surveillance Contact us TEL: +354 525 4000 EMAIL: hi@hi.is Data Protection Policy Report harassment Opening Hours MAIN BUILDING 7:30 am - 5 pm Fri: 7:30 am - 4 pm UNIVERSITY CENTRE 7:30 am - 7:00 pm All opening hours Hi! Could we please enable some additional services for Analytics & Styling ? You can always change or withdraw your consent later. Let me choose I decline That's ok {{language}}"
